DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260604T170000
UID:6932400076261f28005d8d97@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Want to build your skills and confidence? Read aloud to a trai
 ned therapy dog (accompanied by their handler) in a private 20-minute sess
 ion. Grades K – 12.\n¿Quieres mejorar tus habilidades y tu confianza? I
 nscríbete para leer en voz alta a perros de terapia (acompañados por un 
 entrenador) en una sesión privada de 20 minutos. K – 12o grado.\nYou ma
 y sign up for one(1) Read to the Dogs session within a one(1) month period
 .
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Brookwood
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6932400076261f28005d8d97
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Music at the Hearth: The BrazilTones
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T150000
UID:69f26a53deee9abd8ee95ef0@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The BrazilTones are Deborah Bayardino on vocals\, Ronnie Robin
 s on guitar and vocals\, and Brian L. Davis on percussion. They embrace th
 e rhythmic wonder of bossa nova\, samba and MPB (Música Popular Brasileir
 a)\, performing timeless Brazilian classics alongside original composition
 s. Inspired by the poetic lyrics and rich sounds of Brazilian music\, The 
 BrazilTones share joy -- a universal language that unites us all.\nFor adu
 lts. Held at the Library Hearth.
LOCATION:Tualatin Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f26a53deee9abd8ee95ef0
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
