DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260507T163000
UID:699f628581b67dfe32a8e48b@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join our friends from SCRAP Creative Reuse to make some UFOs t
 hat sparkle from space. Put on your helmets\, fellow astronauts\, and expl
 ore the outer reaches of the Milky Way galaxy with us! We'll transform odd
  objects into sparkly planets\, turn clear containers and CDs into glimmer
 ing unidentified flying objects\, and create little creatures from beyond 
 our solar system out of beads\, plastic bits\, pom poms\, googly eyes\, an
 d much\, much more! For children ages 5 and up with adult supervision.
LOCATION:Aloha Community Library
