 nvironment on Zoom where respect and appreciation for differences is enco
 uraged.\nLed by former faculty in special education and supported by teach
 er candidates and preservice speech-language pathology students\, particip
 ants will engage in book study activities\, vocabulary building exercises 
 and language and literacy skills appropriate for a wide range of learners.
 \nRegistration required. This series will be virtual via Zoom. You will re
 ceive the Zoom link when you register for the class.
