UID:69f2686766c3387a9d0851f1@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Bring a friend and join us Wednesday nights for an art worksho
 p! Enjoy dedicated time for art and unwinding. In the month of June we wil
 l host two classes exploring drawing with charcoal. We will use a differen
 t beginner-friendly still life in each class. During the sessions we will 
 draft simplified shapes and use charcoal to block in values\, with a focus
  on constructive corrections\, adding highlights and detail. All materials
  are provided and all skill levels are welcome.\nFor adults and teens 14+.
  Registration is required. Held in the Makerspace.
