BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bee Amazed!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260617T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260617T170000
UID:69e2e91bc1cf6f9a758623d7@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Catch the buzz and be delighted as you zoom into the wonderful
  world of Oregon bees—we have over 500 different kinds! Discover mason b
 ees\, cuckoo bees\, mining bees\, longhorn bees\, and\, of course\, honeyb
 ees. They are vital to our food supply and endlessly fascinating. Enjoy lo
 ts of hands-on science fun and buzz-worthy activities while exploring thes
 e mighty mini-beasts of nature.\nPresented by the UO Museum of Natural and
  Cultural History. This program is for all ages.
LOCATION:Cornelius Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e2e91bc1cf6f9a758623d7
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
