DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T173000
UID:69c5c94f81b67dfe32af467a@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Wednesday for an informal and relaxed space wher
 e you can practice language learning! Gain confidence by learning from oth
 ers and meet new friends!\n*This is not a structured language class* but m
 ore of a space to practice what you already know with native language spea
 kers.\nFor adults. Held in the Community Room.
LOCATION:Tualatin Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c5c94f81b67dfe32af467a
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
