BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ready\, Set\, Kindergarten: Let's Talk @ Murray Scholls
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T110000
UID:69ceaf6f81b67dfe32b0aab4@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Ready\, Set\, Kindergarten is a special 5-class series designe
 d for families. We will help you and your child get ready for Kindergarten
  with music\, stories\, art\, and play! All participants get a free book a
 t each class they attend. Ages 4-5.\nMay 19: Read to Learn\nMay 21: Let's
  Be Friends\nMay 26: Reading & Writing\nMay 28: Let's Talk\nMay 30: Playin
