DESCRIPTION:Welcome infants 0-12 months and their caregivers!\nAttending B
 aby Storytime is a great way to build the bond between child and adult.\nI
 n this program you and your baby will sing songs\, play action rhymes\, an
 d grow together with books.\n15 minutes of playtime for babies and convers
 ation time for adults follows.\nThis is the spring session of this program
  and it runs March 31 –May 19\, 2026.\nWe understand how difficult it is
  to be punctual with a baby. Arrive anytime between 9:30a.m. – 10:00a.m
 . to enjoy this program. Playtime is just as beneficial as the storytime.
 \nLibrary opens at 10:00 a.m.\nBaby Storytime takes a break May 26 - Septe
 mber 1\, 2026. Fall session of Baby Storytime begins September 8\, 2026.
