BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Staying Safe Online - Don’t Fall for It!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260520T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260520T123000
UID:69cc5a1e4dacf581ff85af57@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Criminals are getting better at targeting and tricking more vi
 ctims every day as online frauds continue to grow in frequency and sophist
 ication. It is getting harder and harder to keep yourself and loved ones s
 afe. Join Chris Aedo to learn about online safety\, the importance of prot
 ecting personal information\, how to identify online threats\, and more ab
 out how these scams actually work so you can recognize new variations. Thi
 s presentation will provide attendees with tools and resources to keep the
 mselves\, as well as their friends and family\, safe online.
LOCATION:Beaverton City Library\, Meeting Room B
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69cc5a1e4dacf581ff85af57
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
