BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Interactive Workshop for Job Seekers
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260527T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260527T173000
UID:69d83061e2a2952aed0dcaf9@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a new job but unclear where to start?\nLooking for
  job search tactics that work in today’s job market?\nJoin us for this i
 nformative and practical tutorial! There will be hands-on exercises to ide
 ntify your strengths and skills\, which will be used to create content for
  your resume and social media presence. We’ll also dive into tactics for
  a job search\, including the strategic use of AI\, that give you the best
  odds of success without burning you out.\nYou’ll leave with resume and 
 LinkedIn content\, a job search plan\, and a refreshed understanding of th
 e best approaches for job search success in today’s job market.\nLed by 
 Julie Fleischer - Workshop Facilitator and Community Leader
LOCATION:Aloha Community Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69d83061e2a2952aed0dcaf9
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
