DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260514T170000
UID:69c5ccb2b48451fc3c0b8c1e@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Musicians from Portland Baroque Orchestra explore what makes m
 usic from centuries ago sound fresh and vibrant for modern ears. Cellist a
 nd viola da gamba player Adaiha MacAdam-Somer leads a string ensemble thro
 ugh familiar and surprising works. Held at the Library Hearth. For all age
 s.
LOCATION:Tualatin Public Library\, Hearth
