DESCRIPTION:Become comfortable utilizing the video software Google Meet. C
 ommonly used in interview settings and work meetings\, this class prepares
  students for using video call software in professional settings. In this 
 class students will learn how to create or join a call\, video call etique
 tte\, and the different settings and control options on Google Meet. Learn
  modern job search skills\, including navigating online postings\, spottin
 g red flags\, extracting key qualifications\, and creating a strong Indeed
  profile. Perfect for beginners or those refining their approach to stand 
 out to employers.
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Brookwood
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6994f83b8b29ea2800d0b4a5
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
