UID:69e91ead1e64afd01e6afb6f@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Need help getting started with e-books\, adding an app to your
  smartphone\, or updating your email contacts? Volunteers will be availabl
 e at Open Lab to answer questions. Bring your own computer\, tablet\, cell
 phone\, or e-reader with you to get assistance or use one of our laptops t
 o practice. Be sure to have any usernames and passwords available for acc
 ounts you need help navigating.\nOur summer session of Technology Open Lab
  meets 1-3 pm on Thursdays\, 6/11\, 6/25\, 7/9\, 7/23\, 8/6\, and 8/20.\nD
 rop-in sessions\, no registration is required\, but there is limited space
  each session.\nFor more information please call 503-644-0043 or ask staff
  at any service desk.
LOCATION:Cedar Mill Library\, Main Library Floor
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e91ead1e64afd01e6afb6f
