BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fun for Ones
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260519T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260519T104500
UID:69d16fcdb6c4ac1fedca3a56@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome toddlers 12 months – 24 months and their caregivers!
 \nAttending Fun for Ones Storytime is a great way to build the bond betwee
 n child and adult.\nIn this program you and your toddler will sing songs\,
  play action rhymes\, and grow together with books.\n20 minutes of playtim
 e for kids and conversation time for adults follows the session.\nThis is 
 the spring session of this program and it runs March 31 – May 19\, 2026.
 \nArrive anytime between 10:15 a.m. – 11:00a.m. to enjoy this program. W
 e understand how difficult it is to be punctual with a toddler. Playtime i
 s just as beneficial as the storytime.\nFun for Ones takes a break May 26
  - September 1\, 2026. Fall session of Fun for Ones begins September 8\, 2
 026.
LOCATION:Sherwood Public Library\, Community Room\, main floor
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69d16fcdb6c4ac1fedca3a56
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
