DESCRIPTION:Bored? In need of fun? Come hang out at the library Friday eve
 nings with other teens! There will be movie choices\, board games\, and ot
 her possibilities for fun!\nYou must be in the Teen Room by 6:00PM to atte
 nd. No late entry. Parents will pick up teens from the parking lot behind 
 the library at 8:00PM.
