BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wind Down Wednesdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260603T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260603T110000
UID:69c70d2758f0b64d9e7c0170@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Start your morning off right and join us in the Rogers Room on
  the first Wednesday of every month for a free one-hour intro level class 
 designed to help manage stress and promote well-being through progressive 
 muscle relaxation\, mindfulness\, and deep breathing.Teacher Ruby offers p
 ractical tips for identifying stressors in your life\, implementing simple
  coping mechanisms\, and cultivating emotional survival skills that focus 
 on humor and creativity. Bring your own pillow and/or mat\, wear comfy clo
 thes\, and prepare to fully unwind.\nThis class is open to adults 16 years
  or older\, but registration is required\, and enrollment is limited to 20
  people.
LOCATION:Forest Grove City Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c70d2758f0b64d9e7c0170
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
