DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T120000
UID:69af4f5db0595799c0a1fe5b@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Storytime Wednesdays at 11:00 a.m.\nTime for stories\, bubbles
 \, and songs! Following storytime Mrs. Emily will teach children to identi
 fy and sound out letters of the alphabet and counting basics. Parents and 
 caregivers learn meaningful techniques that will help expand learning expe
 riences at home with your child. Drop in\, no registration required.\nIf a
 ccommodations would help you attend one of our library events or classes\,
  please ask. Our library events are always free!
LOCATION:North Plains Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69af4f5db0595799c0a1fe5b
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:My Peaceful Day: Mindfulness and Meditation for Stress Management
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T110000
UID:69b496b9c94c122f19bdedfe@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover how to transform stress into resilience through this 
 practical\, introductory class on mindfulness and meditation.  In a world 
 filled with social media and invitations to panic\, this class offers a ge
 ntle introduction to evidence-based techniques designed to help you quiet 
 a racing mind\, reduce physical tension\, and cultivate a sense of inner p
 eace regardless of external chaos.  Teacher Ruby brings over two decades o
 f practice and experience to share mindfulness basics\, guided meditations
 \, stress reduction tools and self-care practices.  No prior experience is
  required.\nThe class is free and open to adults 16 and older\, but regist
 ration is required\, and class size is limited to 20 people. Students are
  welcome to wear comfortable clothing and bring mats and pillows.
LOCATION:Forest Grove City Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69b496b9c94c122f19bdedfe
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
