DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260504T120000
UID:69af5d558966a226aae16ef9@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Is your child ready to read?\nOur state recognized kindergarte
 n reading readiness program provides fun early literacy opportunities for 
 young ones with an emphasis on learning to read!\nGrown ups and caregivers
  will engage in explicit reading instruction activities with their little 
 one throughout the class.\nInstill a love of reading this spring with Mrs.
  Emily.
LOCATION:North Plains Public Library\, 31334 NW Commercial St\, North Plai
 ns\, OR 97133
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69af5d558966a226aae16ef9
