BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Citizenship Class Provided by SOAR
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260625T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260625T193000
UID:698e3bba4dacf581ff7ae19e@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays\, April 9 - June 25\nThese free Citizenship classes 
 are designed to prepare learners for the U.S. naturalization interview and
  exam\, which includes an assessment of English reading and writing abilit
 ies\, U.S. history\, and government. Study ONLINE or IN-PERSON.\nParticipa
 nts will:\nStudy U.S. history and civics lessons (100 questions on citizen
 ship exam)\nImprove your English speaking\, listening\, writing\, and read
 ing\nPractice for the naturalization interview\nSign up at:\nhttps://soarl
 egal.org/our-services/citizenship-classes/\nFor more information\, call (5
 03) 379-1598 or email\njstephenson@emoregon.org
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Brookwood
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/698e3bba4dacf581ff7ae19e
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
