BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kathak: Classical Dance from Northern India
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T104500
UID:69d179d69057005337d27dd3@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:We are celebrating Asian American and Pacific Islander month w
 ith  Kathak\, a dance style from Northern India\, featuring the talent of 
 Shivani Joshi. Kathak is one of the eight major forms of Indian classical
  dance based on scenes from the life of Krishna.\nAt this event you and yo
 ur family will experience the beauty\, expressive\, and vibrant movements 
 based in rhythm accompanied by traditional music of India.\nLearn more ab
 out Shivani Joshi\,\nhere\n.\nEveryone welcome!\nNo registration required.
 \nThis is an all ages event.
LOCATION:Sherwood Public Library\, Community Room\, main floor.
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69d179d69057005337d27dd3
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
