DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260621T150000
UID:6922178e06078d3600795042@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Whether you’re writing just for fun\, hoping for publication
 \, or \nplanning to self-publish\, join us for a hands-on inspiring gather
 ing of \npeople who love to write. Newcomers welcome!\nThis event will be 
 hybrid online and in person. If you already receive e-mail from the Writer
 s' Mill\, you'll receive a link for this meeting a few days before the eve
 nt.\nIf you're new\, and need the Zoom link\, please e-mail askuscml@wccls
 .org.\nGroup website:\nportlandwritersmill.org\nSee the group’s antholog
 ies\nin the library catalog\n.\nFor more information\, contact group facil
 itator Sheila Deeth at SheilaD@portlandwritersmill.org.
LOCATION:Cedar Mill Library\, Elm and Oak Room
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6922178e06078d3600795042
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
