BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Puzzle Swap
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260616T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260616T200000
UID:69ecf08cb6c4ac1fedcec8e3@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in and get a new to you jigsaw puzzle. We'll have puzzle
 s of all shapes and sizes and for all ages.\nPlease make sure any puzzles 
 you bring are in good condition\, in their original box\, and have all th
 eir pieces. Also\, if possible\, please make sure pieces are inside a bag 
 in the box. Boxes do not need to be taped - and we prefer that they are no
 t. Thank you!
LOCATION:Garden Home Community Library\, This swap will take place in the 
 library's event space. Enter via the main entrance of the rec center and w
 alk through the building to GeRoom #7\, next to the locker rooms.
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69ecf08cb6c4ac1fedcec8e3
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Intel Singers sing Patriotic Songs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260608T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260608T193000
UID:69ecedfbb6c4ac1fedcec893@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Registration is requested to ensure we have enough chairs.\nPl
 ease join us for this all ages concert with the Intel Singers. The group 
 will perform patriotic songs to celebrate 250 years of the United States o
 f America.\nThe Intel Singers have been together for 27 years. They are a 
 combination of Intel Employees\, Retirees\, Contract Workers and family me
 mbers. They have a great time rehearsing in the corporate conference rooms
  at Intel during the lunch hour\, and always return to work  feeling refre
 shed and renewed.  We are proud to announce Bernie Kuehn\, founding direct
 or of the Oregon Chorale\, will be guest conducting three pieces with the 
 Intel Singers this season.
LOCATION:Garden Home Community Library\, Enter via the rec center's main e
 ntrance and walk through the building to GeRoom #7 (our  library event spa
 ce)\, which is next to the locker rooms.
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69ecedfbb6c4ac1fedcec893
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Virtual Nerd Night: Trivia for Adults
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260602T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260602T194500
UID:69eced33defec6489cc0329e@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:How much do you know about the four themed sets of questions? 
 Themes change monthly. You can play solo but we include hard questions and
  recommend playing as a team (up to 5 people). For Prizes we give out poi
 nts – which can be used at a future trivia night - to those with the hig
 hest and lowest number of correct answers.\nThe freebie question\, answer 
 sheet and meeting details will be emailed to registrants around noon on t
 he day of the event. We will also send this out to late registrants around
  6 pm.
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69eced33defec6489cc0329e
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
