BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Digital Navigator Tech Help
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T154500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T161500
UID:69c71e9d8d5e2d0933681523@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you need one-on-one assistance with your digital questions?
  A trusted guide can help you learn about home connectivity\, devices\, an
 d digital skills. Register for a slot. Bring your device or use a library 
 computer.\nRegistrants will be contacted for more details.\nSlots are 30-4
 0 minutes long. Sign up for your preferred time slot: 3\, 3:45\, 4:30\, or
  5:15. [We do not have a waitlist\; please call or visit the library the 
 day off the Digital Navigator appointment to check availability.]\nThe Dig
 ital Navigator Program (DNP) is a free service made possible by a partners
 hip between Washington County Cooperative Library Services (WCCLS) and the
  American Connections Corps\, who empowers its members and the communities
  they serve to address digital disparities and create lasting change.
LOCATION:Garden Home Community Library\, Enter via the Rec Center's Main e
 ntrance and walk through the building to the library.
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c71e9d8d5e2d0933681523
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cosplay Meet-up
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T113000
UID:699f2f57ec71a31f5b412dcb@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Collaboratory to learn about crafting costumes
  for cosplaying! All skill levels and skill sets are welcome.  We have bas
 ic supplies and equipment.  Drop-in anytime and bring your own projects.\n
 Ages 12+.\nThe space is dedicated to this particular activity\, no regist
 ration required.\n#Collaboratory
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Brookwood
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699f2f57ec71a31f5b412dcb
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tales to Tails
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260610T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260610T154500
UID:69ebf091deee9abd8ee8e091@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Read to a certified therapy dog in a stress-free environment\,
  now at West Slope Community Library!\nSign-up for a 20-minute reading ses
 sion.\nThis program will help improve your child's reading skills and they
  get to make a new friend by reading aloud to a therapy dog.\nThe dogs and
  handlers are from\nDove Lewis Portland Area Canine Therapy Teams\nand\nPe
 t Partners®
LOCATION:West Slope Community Library\, Check in at front desk.
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69ebf091deee9abd8ee8e091
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
