BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Growing Together in the Early Years: Brain Science\, Practical Too
 ls\, and Support
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260512T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260512T193000
UID:69a21b744dacf581ff7e6fd8@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to understand and enjoy the world of children from b
 irth to 5 and gain practical tools for navigating everyday challenges. Tog
 ether we’ll explore early development\, screen time\, and the brain scie
 nce of behavior while creating a supportive\, judgment-free space for conn
 ection\, learning\, and encouragement as we raise children who thrive. Thi
 s program is part of our Parent Information Series. Adults only.\nPresent
 ed by: Megan Barella\, Parent Specialist.\nRegistration is required. We wi
 ll send you a Zoom link via email an hour before the class begins.\nPresen
 ted by the Cedar Mill and Bethany Libraries.
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a21b744dacf581ff7e6fd8
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Shameless Romance Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260505T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260505T193000
UID:69d5422ec1cf6f9a7583c224@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Our Shameless Romance Book Club’s next read is\nAll the Miss
 ing Pieces\nby Catherine Cowles!\nAfter the disappearance of her twin sist
 er\, Ridley Sawyer manages the\n guilt and grief of her own unresolved cas
 e by using her true crime \npodcast to get justice for other cold cases. H
 er latest case has her \nbutting heads with the local sheriff\, Colter Bro
 oks\, who thinks Ridley \nis just in town to stir up trouble. But when the
  case puts her in danger\n and the two are forced to spend more time toget
 her\, Colter realizes \nthat there’s more to the fiery podcaster than he
  thought. As danger \ncreeps closer\, Ridley and Colter must work together
  to uncover the \ntruth.\nReserve a copy here\n. Also available in eBook a
 nd downloadable audiobook formats.\nWant to read ahead?\nCheck out the Sha
 meless Romance Book Club’s schedule and titles for the rest of 2026!
LOCATION:Aloha Community Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69d5422ec1cf6f9a7583c224
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Candied DNA | ADN Confitado
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T183000
UID:69bb3a30567ba1dd31fdcaa1@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Our bodies are made using DNA as the blueprints\, but what doe
 s it look like? Using different pieces of candy\, we'll create a double-he
 lix DNA model. Then mix and match different pairs of candies placed in bet
 ween to demonstrate how DNA sequence pairs are made\, and the changes they
  reflect in our bodies. And yes\, you can eat them when we're done! This p
 rogram is for teens ages 13-18.\nNuestros cuerpos se forman a partir del A
 DN como plano genético\, pero ¿cómo se ve? Usando diferentes caramelos\
 , crearemos un modelo de doble hélice de ADN. Luego\, mezclaremos y combi
 naremos diferentes pares de caramelos colocados entre las hélices para de
 mostrar cómo se forman las secuencias de ADN y los cambios que reflejan e
 n nuestro cuerpo. ¡Y sí\, podrás comértelos cuando terminemos! Este pr
 ograma está dirigido a adolescentes de 13 a 18 años.
LOCATION:Cornelius Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69bb3a30567ba1dd31fdcaa1
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Immigration Crisis Preparedness | Preparación ante Crisis Migrato
 rias
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T160000
UID:69bb3b88567ba1dd31fdcac3@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you prepared for the unexpected? A family preparedness pla
 n can ensure your children's welfare during immigration detention. Key ste
 ps include designating legal guardians\, securing essential documents\, cr
 eating a “red card” with important contacts\, and arranging financial 
 access for trusted individuals.\nJoin us in empowering families at risk of
  detention or deportation. Access vital resources for immigrants and advoc
 ates to safeguard loved ones and property. Together\, we can make a differ
 ence!\nPresented by SOAR Immigration Legal Services in Spanish.\n¿Estás 
 preparado para lo inesperado? Un plan de preparación familiar puede garan
 tizar el bienestar de tus hijos durante la detención migratoria. Algunos 
 pasos clave incluyen designar tutores legales\, obtener documentos esencia
 les\, crear una "tarjeta roja" con contactos importantes y asegurar el acc
 eso financiero para personas de confianza.\nÚnete a nosotros para empoder
 ar a las familias en riesgo de detención o deportación. Accede a recurso
 s vitales para inmigrantes y defensores para proteger a tus seres queridos
  y tus bienes. ¡Juntos podemos marcar la diferencia!\nPresentado por SOAR
  Immigration Legal Services en español.
LOCATION:Cornelius Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69bb3b88567ba1dd31fdcac3
