SUMMARY:Digital Navigator One-On-One Tech Help
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260505T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260505T120000
UID:69efc4e72866a5b4884b3090@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Digital Navigator One-On-One Tech Help each Tuesday from 10:0
 0 a.m. -12:00 p.m. in the library.\nNeed help with digital questions or jo
 b searches? This free program is in partnership with American Connection C
 orps & The Washington County Broadband Action Team. Bring your own device 
 or use library computers.\nSign up for a 1 hour appointment.\nIf no appoin
 tments are scheduled drop in tech help will be available.\nThe Digital Nav
 igator Program (DNP) is a free service made possible by a partnership\nbet
 ween Washington County Cooperative Library Services (WCCLS) and the Washin
 gton\nCounty Broadband Action Team. The DNP is funded in part by American 
 Connections\nCorps\, an AmeriCorps program dedicated to advancing economic
  prosperity by bridging\nthe digital divide. This project is being support
 ed\, in part\, by federal award number\nSLFRP0228 awarded to Washington Co
 unty by the U.S. Department of the Treasury.
LOCATION:North Plains Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69efc4e72866a5b4884b3090
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
