DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T120000
UID:69f145b32866a5b4884b7b57@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Does jump starting your baby's language skills while also incr
 easing your bond with them sound good? Then this monthly play group is for
  you! You will learn the basics of using American Sign Language with your 
 baby through songs and play.\nFor caregivers and children 0-2 years old. R
 egistration is suggested but not required. Held in the Community Room.
LOCATION:Tualatin Public Library\, Community Room
